[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1681.19, "timestamp": "00:28:01", "text": "做……嗯，该怎么称呼它的地方？ 推特"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1683.269, "timestamp": "00:28:03", "text": "空间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1686.31, "timestamp": "00:28:06", "text": "而这正是我测试"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1687.83, "timestamp": "00:28:07", "text": "空间的时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1691.83, "timestamp": "00:28:11", "text": "呃，也是在那时，我第一次遇到了另一位"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1695.43, "timestamp": "00:28:15", "text": "日本人。 我们聊了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1705.029, "timestamp": "00:28:25", "text": "是的，我在这里遇到了纳加桑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1708.549, "timestamp": "00:28:28", "text": "所以，虽然我没能在现实生活中见到他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1717.669, "timestamp": "00:28:37", "text": "是的，我当时在场。 下雨了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1719.269, "timestamp": "00:28:39", "text": "我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1722.87, "timestamp": "00:28:42", "text": "就想，是啊，在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1728.31, "timestamp": "00:28:48", "text": "我回归直播之前，我正在推特上直播，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1731.59, "timestamp": "00:28:51", "text": "然后Nagasan加入了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1733.269, "timestamp": "00:28:53", "text": "那是我第一次和"}]